             QuickRun(tm) instructions for CPDownload:
             

UnZip CPDownload into your main Telix directory.  Review the documentation 
quickly.  Load Telix.  Execute (Alt-G) CPD.  CPD will load the configuration
program (CPDS).  It will then re-load itself, and commence operation.



